window.products.push({"id":933055,"name":"POWEART Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 26Kpa 350W Powerful Stick Vacuum, 8 in 1 Self-Standing Rechargeable Battery Vacuum Up to 45min Runtime, Lightweight C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hqQJ-e4fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Powerful Suction & Deep Cleaning】The cordless vacuum cleaner is powered by a 350W super-strong brushless motor and generates up to 26KPa powerful suction while keeping a relatively quiet environment. Stick vacuum cleaner cordless with 2 mode design can perform decently on all kinds of hard floors, such as tile, marble, and wood floor; at high speed, it is suitable for cleaning short piles of carpet, pet hair, and larger particles like cereal, cat litter, dust, etc. 【8-in-1 Versatile & Multi-purpose】Cordless vacuum is perfect for multi-task cleaning with a retractable tube, a flexible hose, and 3 useful attachments - main floor brush head, 2-in-1 brush, and crevice tool. Using the extended tube and main brush, the cordless stick vacuum can work well and move freely from hard floors to low-pile carpets. When converted to a cordless handheld vacuum with the 2-in-1 brush or crevice tool, it is suitable for cleaning places like stairs, shelve, sofas, and cars. 【5-Stage High-efficiency Filtration System】With a 5-stage high-efficiency filtering system, the lightweight vacuum cleaner captures and traps 99.99% of dust as small as 0.1 microns, keeping your home clean and healthy. A washable strainer and reusable HEPA of vacuum can filter dust and dirt, protecting the motor and ensuring the vacuum works properly. The high-density HEPA filter filtration performance is 200% more efficient than cotton filters and can last for a longer period of time. 【45 mins Long-lasting Runtime】This rechargeable vacuum cleaner cordless is equipped with an advanced 8-cell lithium battery with a 2200m-A-h large capacity, which supports 45 min max runtime on Standard mode and 20 min max on High speed. It takes only about 4.5 hours for a full charge, the detachable feature provides 2 charging options - it can be charged when in the vacuum or separately. You can prepare a spare pack if needed, very convenient and time-saving. 【Flexible LED Motorized Floor Head】Battery stick vacuum cordless feature LED motorized floor heads with beater rollers. There are both soft and stiff bristles on the roller, which can spin quickly to sweep up dirt from a variety of floors without scratching them. LED lights at the front help track dirt in dark and difficult-to-reach places. Cleaning underneath furniture like beds, tables, etc. Becomes much easier when the floor vacuum head can be rotated 90° vertically and 150° horizontally.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hqQJ-e4fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"POWEART","source_asin":"B09KNQC2FJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KNQC2FJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KNQC2FJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
