window.products.push({"id":933107,"name":"Glass Food Storage Containers with Eco Friendly, Sustainable Bamboo Lids, Set of 4. Plastic Free, BPA Free. Includes Bamboo Cutlery & Adjustable Wrap.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LcLnquMUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHILE OTHERS INCLUDE JUST THE SET, our 4 pack of large glass containers for food storage with lids includes a set of bamboo cutlery with an adjustable elastic wrap. This makes our middle two sizes perfect for not just food storage but taking your lunch on the go. Fits our 2.75 and 4.25 cup sizes. WHY WE DO WHAT WE DO: At Gramercy Kitchen Company, we love to create beautiful, useful products that are healthy for your family and kind to the environment. Because of this, we've created our glass container set with eco-friedly bamboo lids. Also, we have included ZERO plastic in our storage set or in our packaging. QUALITY IS OUR PRIORITY: Our borosilicate glass containers are made of some of the strongest glass out there. It's not totally unbreakable, but it almost is! Our containers are heat and cold resistant from 400 F to -20 F and absorb thermal shock of 120 degrees. Works great in the freezer or the microwave. Our lids lock perfectly to the glass containers with our BPA free, eco-friendly silicone seal, creating an airtight seal to keep your food fresh. *bamboo lids not for microwave or dishwasher GROOVED LIDS MAKE FOR EASY, MESS-FREE STACKING: Some containers use a flat lid which isn't great for stacking. Your containers with lids can slide around and fall off. Our stackable food containers have lids that are grooved. No sliding, messy stacks of containers. CUSTOMER CARE PROMISE: GKC strives to create complete customer satisfaction, period. Our customers mean more to us than our sales. If you are unhappy with your glass container set for any reason, we will replace or refund your order. Zero questions asked. We also love answering any questions. Don’t hesitate to reach out - we love to help!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LcLnquMUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gramercy Kitchen Company","source_asin":"B07VLPJBKL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VLPJBKL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VLPJBKL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
