window.products.push({"id":933284,"name":"Kids Pikachu Themed Cotton 28\"x58\" Beach Towel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z7YeeD0dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For the ultimate in comfort and style, the best Pokemon trainers choose this Pokemon beach towel. Featuring colorful characters from the popular card and video game franchise, this towel is a fun way for any trainer to dry off. Pokemon characters Pikachu, Charmander, Meowth, Eevee, Bulbasaur, Squirtle, and Piplup bring action-packed style to this soft multicolored towel. The generous size and smooth surface of this 28\" x 58\" towel make it a welcome addition to any linen closet. It's crafted from a quick-drying fabric that feels soft against the skin and keeps sand away while kids relax on the beach. Suitable for indoor or outdoor use, the cute design is a fun choice for a decorative wall hanging as well as a cozy towel. Pokemon Kids Super Soft Cotton Beach Towel, 28” x 58”, Blue 100% Cotton POKEMON DESIGN: Level up with this cool and colorful Pokemon beach towel to dry off after a bath or swim. Surround your child in super comfort and style with help from Pikachu, Charmander, Meowth, Eevee, Bulbasaur, Squirtle, and Piplup. SOFT & COZY TOWEL: From the bathtub to the beach, this towel delivers cozy comfort with its smooth surface and soft touch. Kids and parents alike will appreciate how the durable fabric keeps sand away and offers quick-drying convenience. GREAT FOR INDOOR & OUTDOOR USE: This versatile towel brings colorful style and cozy comfort to a bath, pool, or beach near you. Whether your kids are lying on it to soak up the sun or using it to soak up the water after a swim, it’s always got them covered. It even works as a fun poster or decal on their bedroom wall. EASY CARE: You can throw the towel into the washer and dryer without worrying about the color fading making it a fun indoor and outdoor accessory. ITEM INCLUDES: A beach towel measuring 28” (W) X 58” (L). It's large and fun to use for all ages. The towel is lightweight and folds easily to carry when traveling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Z7YeeD0dL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beach Towel","source_asin":"B09YNJ843M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933284","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YNJ843M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YNJ843M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":933285,"name":"yixing Milano Stovetop Espresso Maker Moka pot 1 espresso Cup - 1.5 fl oz, Cuban Coffee Maker Stove top coffee maker Moka Italian espresso greca coffe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-WWwOjEzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Espresso is a specialty coffee brewed by forcing small amounts of nearly boiling water under pressure through finely ground coffee beans. Espresso is generally more highly concentrated than coffee brewed by other methods, often featuring a rich flavor and a creamy foam on top.The Aluminum Espresso Maker features a modern, stylish design with a high-quality aluminum body. The handle is made from a heat resistant plastic that not only provides you with a firm and reliable grip, but also allows your hand to stay cool during use. Its efficient layout forces pressurized water through coffee grounds, and deposits a rich, full bodied espresso blend into the serving chamber.Espresso is one of the most popular ways to consume coffee, and this espresso maker can be used to make popular and delicious coffee recipes like cappuccinos, lattes, americanos, macchiatos and mochas. Espresso can also be enjoyed as a shot for those who enjoy fuller flavored coffee.Unscrew the top and remove the filter funnel from the base. Fill the base with fresh water up to the level of the safety valve and insert the filter funnel. Fill the filter funnel with finely ground coffee (do not press down), and screw the top firmly to the base.Easy to clean and easy to use. Place the espresso maker on low to medium heat, and within 3-5 minutes, delicious espresso will fill the serving chamber. Serve immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-WWwOjEzL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yixing","source_asin":"B093LR4LH1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093LR4LH1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093LR4LH1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":933286,"name":"3 Generations of Sons Personalized Wooden Picture Frame 5\" x 7\" Brown (Vertical)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QvEA1SAqL._AC_.jpg","description":"3 Generations of Sons Personalized Wooden Picture Frame 5\" x 7\" Brown (Vertical) Having your name survive from one generation to the next is a great pleasure for anyone. We all want our legacies to live on, and the best way to do this is by perpetuating our lineage. Get this 3 Generations of Sons Personalized Wooden Picture Frame to hold memories of the three generations of sons in your lineage. It could be you, your father and your son, or you, your son and your grandson, or you, your father and your grandfather. That makes a generation of three. Celebrate the memories that three of you have made with each other and display them beautifully in your living spaces to share with everyone else in your lives. Material: Wooden Material: Wooden Layouts: Horizontal or Vertical Layouts: Horizontal or Vertical Dimensions: 5\" x 7\" Dimensions: 5\" x 7\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QvEA1SAqL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Center Gifts","source_asin":"B07NY35FVN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NY35FVN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NY35FVN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
