window.products.push({"id":933456,"name":"Exclusive Transparent Quartz crystal whiskey stones, high quality whiskey stones gift box set of 6 stone cubes and a velvet storage pouch. Enjoy your ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818VN5lFx+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cherrish's high quality Quartz Crystal Whisky Rocks will chill and take the edge off your favorite spirit drink without diluting it. Unlike traditional ice cubes, the Whisky Rocks will not melt, therefore don’t water down and weaken the taste of your drink. They are reusable, non-porous and odourless and do not impart flavour. They offer a perfectly chilled drink from the first sip to the last! Enjoy true taste of your favourite Scotch, Brandy, Whisky, Bourbon or Single Malt, pure and non-diluted. With other cocktails made up of Vodka, Cognac, Rum or Gin simple increase the number of stones per glass based on the quantity of the beverage. For best results, pour the drink over the cooling rocks, filling it until the drink covers the rocks. 100% natural high quality Quartz Crystal for it’s function to provide for a more sustained chill To use Whisky Rocks simply store them in a freezer in their velvet pouch. When needed, simply rinse with water before dropping 2 or 3 rocks (depending in desired temperature) into your drink to enjoy. For effective cooling, place then in the freezer 4 hours before use. Wash Whisky Rocks before first use. To clean, rinse with warm water. Features Cut from high quality Quartz Crystal - known for its function to provide for a more sustained chill Dimension: 2 x 2 x 2cm Set includes 6 Whisky Rocks, complete with velvet storage pouch Non-porous - will impart neither flavour nor odour Rounded edges to prevent scratching Reusable","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/818VN5lFx+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cherrish","source_asin":"B077XYDKWM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077XYDKWM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077XYDKWM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
