window.products.push({"id":933537,"name":"TOKTEKK 12 Inch Real Moving Gear Large Wall Clock Vintage Industrial Oversized Rustic Farmhouse (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-+wIhGaeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Premium Material & Perfect Size：The Real Moving Gear Wall Clock is made of quality metal iron which is more stable and durable. Measures 24\" in diameter, 2.5'' in depth, weight-8.8 lbs, with large roman number making it easy to read time. Real Moving Gear：Gears are prominent in industry and also have the meaning of solidarity. European Industrial Metal Wall Clock is not only a timepiece, but also a great iron art works. Accurate Movements：Precise Quartz Sweep Movement runs calm and smoothly,it not only guarantees accurate time, but ensures a good sleeping and work environment.No more loud annoying ticking sounds, simply enjoy peace as time goes by. Wide Application & Nice Gift：The Real Moving Gear Wall Clock fits to any home, business, cafe or bar. Perfect for living room, bedroom, kitchen, office, coffee, loft, hotel and more.Of course it also can be a nice gift for your family or friends on birthdays, festivals and anniversaries. Wall Clock Battery Operated:Use 3 AA CARBON ZINC BATTERY (Non Include,one for Sweep Movement,the other two for moving gears ). For longer use, do not use Alkaline battery or high power battery, they will affect the accuracy of time.(Note: Plus side of your battery should be inserted first) Back slot design offers easy installation (1 hook included.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-+wIhGaeL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOKTEKK","source_asin":"B08LCVFQ35","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933537","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LCVFQ35","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LCVFQ35","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
