window.products.push({"id":933707,"name":"Kitchen Rugs Kitchen Mat Set of 2 Kitchen Rug Non-Slip Kitchen Rugs and Mats 47.3x17.3/31.5x17.3 Inch Floor Mat Doormat Runner Rug for Kitchen, Laundr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6109V-A0vxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【Kind Reminder】Dear customers, due to transportation and squeezing, the kitchen carpet you receive may have creases, which is normal. You can roll up the carpet in the reverse and keep the state for a while to restore it to the flat state. Or you can also use ironing machines to iron this carpet to quickly restore the flat state. 【2 Pcs Kitchen Rugs】The kitchen rug sets are made of high quality polyester materials, which will not break down or compress. This floor mat is anti-scratch and anti-break. The back is designed with anti-slip spots, which can stick on the floor and won't slip easily. 【Easy To Maintain】The kitchen mats are easy to clean, you can use a vacuum cleaner to finish your daily simple cleaning. After using the carpet for a long time, the deep cleaning can be finished by hand wash or machine wash (recommended in the washing bags). 【Multi-purpose Carpets】17.3 x 31.5/17.3 x 47.3 inch kitchen carpet not only applies to the kitchen, it can also be used in living room, bedroom, bathroom, office, laundry, door, outdoor, porch, balcony and entrance. It's also a perfect runner rug. The black kitchen carpet set allows your room to look clean and attractive 【Wonderful Decorations】Modern designed carpet set is simple and generous. Beautiful design can match a variety of design styles, it’s also a good choice for decorating your kitchen, living room, bedroom","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6109V-A0vxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JLYLOL","source_asin":"B09ZXZHRYT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933707","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZXZHRYT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZXZHRYT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":933708,"name":"Mozaik Hammered Silver Premium Plastic 12” Chargers/Serving Platters, 8 count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YFY8GPkIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Entertaining friends and family is a lot of fun, but when the last guest walks out the door, there’s usually an overwhelming pile of dirty dishes and wine glasses. But paper plates aren’t always sturdy, plastic cutlery can be flimsy, and while you wouldn’t want your guests sipping a delicious vintage from a red plastic cup, you also don’t want your favorite wine glasses getting broken during a particularly rowdy game of charades. Mozaik Premium Plastic Tableware offers the same durability, versatility, and convenience of ordinary disposable paper goods, but has the elevated look and feel of real plates, silverware, and glasses. Mozaik also offers a full assortment of serving bowls, platters, and utensils, as well as appetizer and dessert plates and cups that are perfect for tastings and special events. BPA-free and Kosher-Parve certified, every Mozaik piece comes with the added bonus of recyclability OR reusability – when your event is over you can recycle your used dishes and glassware without feeling guilty about waste, or you can hand wash them and store them for your next dinner party, event, or barbecue. There’s no need to dread the post-party cleanup again – you’ll spend less time in the kitchen and more time enjoying your guests (and food!). Dress up your dinner table and make place settings pop with Mozaik Hammered Silver Premium Plastic 12” Chargers. Each set includes eight (8) chargers with a textured finish, perfect for formal dinners, special celebrations, or holiday meals. Available in both gold and silver, they’re a gorgeous complement to your favorite table linens. The 12” size of the chargers also make them excellent serving platters. At parties, set out trays of hors d’ouevres and cocktails, or at Sunday brunch, present a beautiful avocado toast bar with trays full of toppings. When the party’s over, these BPA-free chargers can be hand washed and put away for your next get together, or recycled – it’s easy, no-mess, no-stress entertaining.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91YFY8GPkIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mozaik","source_asin":"B09NHCC2ZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933708","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NHCC2ZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NHCC2ZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
