window.products.push({"id":933783,"name":"ChrisDowa Light Filtering Roller Shades, Sheer Window Blinds with Light and Privacy Control for Office and Home. Easy to Install.White,23\" W x 72\" H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M2I6nsJ5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PRODUCT DETAILS:【Blind Size】: 23”W x 72”H,【Fabric Size】: 22”W x 72”H. Noted: The fabric width is 1” narrower than total width. Made of 101% polyester, feeling soft and smooth. CLASSIC & SAFETY DESIGN: Our shade blind features a sleek and modern look equipped with metal chain and aluminum bottom rod. To ensure safety to your family, we provide a safety device to attach the chain to the wall and all the relevant safety instructions, which always keeps cords and bead chain out of children and pets. · MULTIPLE FUNCTIONS: Our beautiful, budget-friendly light filtering shade provide you with warm, gently filtered light while maintain your privacy. Great for bedroom, living room, kitchen, French door and office. MEASUREMENT: The fabric width is 1” narrower than the total roller width, due to the brackets at the both ends. For inside mount, window frame should have at least 2” depth, and blackout roller shades will have a tiny light gap on each side. To avoid light gap, consider the outside mount. For outside mount, shade should be 4” - 6” wider than window frame, shade length should be at least 2” longer than the window length for better coverage. · EASY TO INSTALL AND MAINTAIN: Our window roller shade contains an accessory kit including metal brackets, screws and install instruction for convenience. Clean with damp cloth, Low Iron. If any accessories are missing or sent wrong, please message us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M2I6nsJ5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ChrisDowa","source_asin":"B096JR321Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933783","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096JR321Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096JR321Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
