window.products.push({"id":933821,"name":"Personalized Bowling Ornaments for Christmas Tree – Sports Fan Ornament for Boys – Bowling Gifts for Men – Bowling Coach Gifts – Bowling Ball and Pins","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.94,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gNLLZ3oOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Polyresin Bowling Decorations 2022 – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our girls bowling ornament is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for special twinkle in your ornament tree décor. Vibrant colors and festive details of a guy bowling ornament with bowling ball and pins! Bring back your great outdoor memories and show your passion to your favorite sport with this bowling ball ornament. Expert Artist Personalization – Other personalized sports ornaments for Christmas tree often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Every bowling Christmas ornament is delicately hand painted to ensure its unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND bowling pin ornament and personalized boys sport ornaments you’ll always cherish. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – and your favorite pastime! Commemorate your family’s favorite activity with this special extreme sports decor honoring the pastime you enjoy together every year! Your personalized sports themed boys Christmas ornament will make the family tree feel extra special and unique to your home. Great addition to your sports party decorations, bowling green ornaments, gifts for bowlers, bowling gifts and novelties, bowling gifts for kids and sports ornaments sets! 24-Hour Order Processing – Our sports fan ornaments make beautiful sports themed decorations, bowling ball gifts, bowler gifts, high school, college sports team gift and bowling gifts for men to cherish every holiday season. Your bowler ornaments will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! Free custom personalization included with your bowling ball tree ornament. Great gifts for bowling fans, coaches and enthusiasts! Happy Bowling Lovers – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful miniature sports ornaments and boy’s ornaments for Christmas tree for families to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your bowling decorations 2022 please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gNLLZ3oOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B09NTT3D8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NTT3D8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NTT3D8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
