window.products.push({"id":933845,"name":"Secopad Non Slip Bathtub Stickers, 20 PCS Shower Floor Non Slip Stickers Bright Flowers Appliques with Premium Scraper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GbTQ-hGqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★Wondering how to keep bathtub or shower floor from being slippery? To address this potentially dangerous situation, we provide the bright flowers shape bathtub non slip stickers for you. The shower non slip stickers set works the same way a tub mat does only that it's easier to set up. It's also lighter and easier to maintain. You only need to stick the individual stickers on the inner surface of your bathtub or the floor of your shower tiles. Also you can stick it as the shape you like. ★Design Principle. Each sticker is made in such a way that it easily attaches to the surface using special glue. The upper surface comes with approximately 1250 tiny protrusions per piece. These protrusions are meant to increase friction. So you can stay safe with it and it’s also gentle for you skin. At the same time, this design is meant to allow water to flow freely further reducing the chances of soapy water accumulating. ★Advantages. These stickers are designed to stick firmly on smooth surfaces (e.g. the soft PEVA material used for bathtubs) offering a strong adhesion and a great grip. This, further, provides you with a long-lasting slip and fall protection. The special glue used for these stickers can easily be removed without leaving any residue behind. And to top it all up, the stickers are non-toxic, fade-free, safe, and convenient to use. You can use the sticker for bathtub, tub, tile shower floor etc. ★The package comprises 20 pieces (12 large PCS: diameter about 11.5cm or 4.53-inch 8 small PCS: diameter about 8.0cm or 3.15-inch) of bright colorful stickers alongside 1 high-quality silicone scraper. Ideally, the 20 stickers should occupy at least 2/3 the surface thereby reducing the risk of accidental slips. On top of that, you can even use these stickers on the stairs to make them much more secure. ★Service. 1 YEAR NO REASON RETURN SERVICE. This ensures that you bath safely, and helps to prevent accidental slips and falls. If you are not 100% satisfied, send us a message and we will make a refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GbTQ-hGqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Secopad","source_asin":"B0BS8RKPW9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS8RKPW9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS8RKPW9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":933846,"name":"RAINBOW Genuine Separator, Fits Model E-2 (eSERIES) ONLY!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.51,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41byoi0wr0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This part separates air from water and allows clean air to flow out through the exhaust and the water to be transferred back to the water pan. Separator for the single speed E-2 (e SERIES™) Rainbow. Does not fit the E2 Type 12 two speed system. Effective July 2000, Rexair has improved this separator to increase performance. Inexpensive upgrade to gain improved cleaning ability. View second image to compare original separator (R7805) with new design. If your nut that holds this item in place is brass, then this is the correct part. If you have a white plastic nut, then you need to order item number R12103.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41byoi0wr0L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RAINBOW","source_asin":"B00L027XIO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00L027XIO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00L027XIO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":933847,"name":"La Rochere Set Of 6, 13.5-ounce Perigord Long Drink Glasses","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JJRe24b8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"La Rochere’s “Perigord” Long Drink Glasses are sturdy and perfect for everyday use. Classic in design,our drinking glasses are both casual and elegant and will compliment any table. A timeless look for serving iced tea, water and juice. Easy to clean our glassware is dishwasher safe. La Rochere drinkware has a stable base and is easy to hold making it perfect for family and guests of all ages. Steeped in tradition La Rochere is the oldest working art glassworks factory in France. La Rochere’s pieces are fired at a very high temperatures producing an exceptional quality glass that is both crystal clear and durable. A pressure seam is sometimes visible, which is the mark left by opening the mould in which the glass is pressed. It is the characteristic of pressed machine glass and symbolizes its heritage and makes each item a true piece of French glass history.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JJRe24b8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"La Rochere","source_asin":"B008P8SM5O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008P8SM5O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008P8SM5O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
