window.products.push({"id":933925,"name":"Waterford Conover 18/10 Stainless Steel 65-Piece Flatware Set with Chest, Service for 12","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+YOUIMQPL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Waterford 18/10 Stainless Steel 65-Piece Flatware Set includes twelve 5-piece place settings, plus five serving pieces: tablespoon, pierced tablespoon, sugar shell, cold meat fork, and butter knife complete with an exclusive, solid hardwood, flannel-lined flatware chest. Distributed by Reed & Barton. Amazon.com Simple yet stately, the Conover flatware pattern from Waterford sets a table for everyday fine dining. A double-band design is carved into the flared end and thin neck of each handle, adding detail without fussiness. The handles are long and flat, and exhibit a substantial heft and pleasing balance. Crafted of superior grade 18/10 stainless steel, the best for luster retention and corrosion resistance, Conover maintains its mirror finish even after years of dishwasher-cleaning. Boxed in a handsome, solid hardwood chest with flannel lining, this 65-piece set is ready for entertaining a large dinner party. Included are 12 place settings, each consisting of a dinner knife, dinner fork, salad fork, soup spoon, and teaspoon. In addition, five serving pieces complete the set: a large serving spoon, large pierced serving spoon, cold meat fork, sugar shell, and butter knife. Distributed by silver company Reed & Barton, the Waterford Conover set makes an excellent wedding or anniversary present. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 12 place settings and 5 serving pieces. Each place setting consists of: dinner knife; dinner fork; salad fork; soup spoon; teaspoon. The serving pieces consist of: large serving spoon; large pierced serving spoon; cold meat fork; sugar shell; butter knife. Wooden chest included also. 66 items total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41+YOUIMQPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reed & Barton","source_asin":"B000N25IAW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933925","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000N25IAW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000N25IAW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
