window.products.push({"id":933933,"name":"AYCCNH Non Stick Musubi Maker Press, BPA Free Sushi Making Kit Onigiri Mold, Non-Toxic Luncheon Meat Press Hawaiian Musubi Maker Mold (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6199Mm4h5wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍣 Premium Musubi Maker: Invite the professional sushi maker kit into your kitchen and you'll be delight to welcome the highest in quality and safety. Our Musubi maker is made of 100% food grade material, BPA free, No Toxic Chemicals. Get the standard size sushi by our 4.06\"x2.16\"x1.89\"(10.3 x 5.5 x 4.8 cm) sushi mold. a1 🍣 Nonstick Surface: Bumpy surface design, including the lining and the press bottom, ensures the rice doesn't stick to the mold, easy to be demoulded. And the curved corner makes the sushi rice a better shape presentation. 🍣 Simple Is Better: Eliminate the sushi rolling mat set, say \"Goodbye\" to the traditional complex making process. You just need to place the musubi maker on the nori, press down the rice, add the spams, press down and make it tightly packed, you'll get the delicious sushi and musubi. Great for making Hawaiian spam musubi, onigiri, sekirei, and kimbab. Simple and save money. 🍣 Easy to Clean: It's easy to clean due to the non-stick surface, you can wash it by hand with dishcloth or brush, not suitable for dishwasher. Small size, easy to store, bring your life more convenience. 🍣 100% Money Back Guarantee: Your satisfaction is our main priority and we strive to offer the high quality product. If the product fails due to defect or workmanship under normal conditions, we will gladly replace it or refund you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6199Mm4h5wL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AYCCNH","source_asin":"B0BYSX64BC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933933","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYSX64BC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYSX64BC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
