window.products.push({"id":933936,"name":"Blomus Stainless-Steel Cylo Canister, 25-Ounce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CJ8XQAYSL._AC_.jpg","description":"Amazon.com Blomus Cylo canisters are designed by SKS Design in Germany, an innovative leader in stainless-steel products for the modern home. Too elegant to hide in a cupboard, Blomus canisters of varying sizes can be clustered on a counter or table. For kitchen use, this 25-ounce model holds coffee, tea, or pasta, and self-adhesive labels for those items in various languages are even included. The canister can also store cotton balls or tampons in a bathroom, and keep favorite pens and pencils from disappearing off a desktop. Made of stainless steel in a matte finish that hides fingerprints, the canister features a plastic throat that screws on the top for a snug (though not air-tight) fit. The 3-3/4-inch top is slightly wider than the base; overall the canister stands 6-3/4 inches high. While the canister is dishwasher-safe, any water or finger marks on the outside can be easily removed with a damp cloth and liquid soap. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31CJ8XQAYSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blomus","source_asin":"B000095SD4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933936","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000095SD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000095SD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
