window.products.push({"id":933942,"name":"Heat-Resistant Iridescent Stemless Wine Glass Set of 6 Gift Tumbler 19.3 oz Made by Premium Borosilicate Glass For Women Plant Lovers, Homewarming, Bi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iR94tb8iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CL - Universal Water Glass Tumbler Set of 6 Iridescent Stemless Wine Glass Perfect Gift for Her Color: Iridescent Rainbow Color CL-Iridescent rainbow color /Metalic Clear Color Stemless Universal Glass Tumblers are made from premium High Borosilicated Glass, they are heat resistant and highly durable. In fact, that's what makes it so famous and sought-after. These glass tumbler combine contemporary style with Color Plated design. With lines and a weighted base, these rocks and tumbler glasses are guaranteed to feel good in your hand, A real treat for the eyes and the palette. The glass tumblers designed for a wide range of drinks, cocktails, or fine bottles of wine. It’s perfect for kitting out the home bar or stocking up in the kitchen. Product Details * Production size: 3.6 x 3.6 x 4.7 inches * Volume: 18.6oz/550ML (Each) * Stemless Glass Tumblers (6 Pc. Set) * Classic Elegant Style, Iridescent Color * High Borosilicated Glass(No Lead and No BPA) * Thin with Heavy Base, Sturdy & Durable * Trusted, Food Safe CL - Housewares is an leading provider of premium homewares products like Glassware, Dinnerware set, Kitchen Storage Solutions. ***Use & Maintains*** * Caring for Glassware to Increase its Lifespan: * HANDWASH ONLY for COLORED glassware to Increase its Lifespan. * Before use, please confirm whether there are cracked or nicks on the glass body, if there are cracked or nicks, do not use. * Always wash new glasses before first use, Hand wash glasses individually recommended. * Do not use rough materials such as steel wool or abrasives for cleaning. * Do not soak with other glasses to reduce the chance of mechanical shock. * Be sure to use soft materials such as sponge (gauze) or a cloth with neutral detergent for cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iR94tb8iL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FAIRCRAFT","source_asin":"B09PM7N5CH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-933942","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PM7N5CH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PM7N5CH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
